<p>A toy but not-embarrassing projection: expected cashflows for a single-life, level-premium term policy. Everything runs <strong>at build time</strong> — the chart below is static Plotly HTML baked into the page, so there’s no runtime and it stays on free static hosting. (When a reader actually needs to change inputs and re-run, that’s when Quarto Live / Shinylive earn their weight — not here.)</p>
<p>The mortality basis is a Gompertz law, purely so the post is self-contained; swap in a real table when you want.</p>
<div id="d0ecc4aa" class="cell" data-execution_count="1">
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode python code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode python"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">import</span> numpy <span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">as</span> np</span>
<span id="cb1-2"><span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">import</span> pandas <span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">as</span> pd</span>
<span id="cb1-3"><span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">import</span> plotly.graph_objects <span class="im" style="color: #00769E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">as</span> go</span>
<span id="cb1-4"></span>
<span id="cb1-5"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># --- Assumptions -----------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span id="cb1-6">issue_age   <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">45</span></span>
<span id="cb1-7">term        <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">20</span>          <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># years</span></span>
<span id="cb1-8">sum_assured <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">250_000</span></span>
<span id="cb1-9">i           <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="fl" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">0.04</span>        <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># valuation rate</span></span>
<span id="cb1-10"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># Gompertz mu(x) = B c^x, chosen to give sensible adult mortality</span></span>
<span id="cb1-11">B, c        <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="fl" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">3.0e-5</span>, <span class="fl" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1.09</span></span>
<span id="cb1-12"></span>
<span id="cb1-13"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># --- Survival / mortality --------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span id="cb1-14">ages <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> issue_age <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">+</span> np.arange(term)</span>
<span id="cb1-15"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># integrate mu over each policy year for a one-year death probability</span></span>
<span id="cb1-16"><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">def</span> qx(age):</span>
<span id="cb1-17">    <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># ∫ B c^s ds from age to age+1  =  B (c^{age+1} - c^{age}) / ln c</span></span>
<span id="cb1-18">    Hx <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> B <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">*</span> (c<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">**</span>(age <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">+</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span>) <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-</span> c<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">**</span>age) <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">/</span> np.log(c)</span>
<span id="cb1-19">    <span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">return</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span> <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-</span> np.exp(<span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-</span>Hx)</span>
<span id="cb1-20"></span>
<span id="cb1-21">q <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> np.array([qx(a) <span class="cf" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">for</span> a <span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">in</span> ages])</span>
<span id="cb1-22">p <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span> <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-</span> q</span>
<span id="cb1-23">tpx <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> np.concatenate(([<span class="fl" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1.0</span>], np.cumprod(p)))[:term]   <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># prob in force at start of yr</span></span>
<span id="cb1-24"></span>
<span id="cb1-25"><span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># --- Level net premium (equivalence principle) ----------------------------</span></span>
<span id="cb1-26">v <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span> <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">/</span> (<span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span> <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">+</span> i)</span>
<span id="cb1-27">disc_start <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> v <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">**</span> np.arange(term)          <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"># discount to start of each year</span></span>
<span id="cb1-28">disc_end   <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> v <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">**</span> (np.arange(term) <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">+</span> <span class="dv" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">1</span>)</span>
<span id="cb1-29"></span>
<span id="cb1-30">apv_benefits <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">=</span> np.<span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">sum</span>(sum_assured <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">*</span> tpx <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">*</span> q <span class="op" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">*</span> disc_end)      <span class="co" style="color: #5E5E5E;
